economy-admin-button = Economy
economy-admin-title = Economy administration
economy-admin-command-description = Open the persistent market settings panel.
economy-admin-command-help = Usage: economyui
economy-admin-reset-console = To change the economy manually, open economyui from an in-game session with economyDB permission and complete all three confirmations.
economy-admin-help = Settings and manual quote changes persist in the database across rounds and restarts. Every write requires three confirmations.
economy-admin-tab-global = Global settings
economy-admin-tab-groups = Commodity groups
economy-admin-tab-quotes = Quotes
economy-admin-global-help = Clear “Override” to inherit current CVars. Disabling dynamics restores base prices: 0% (×1); the purchase margin still applies.
economy-admin-enabled = Dynamic prices enabled
economy-admin-override = Override
economy-admin-source-override = Database / draft
economy-admin-source-default = CVar default
economy-admin-source-group = Share of global strength: { $percent }% (multiplier ×{ $multiplier })
economy-admin-setting-strength = Price increase after buying 1 unit, %
economy-admin-linked-drop = After selling 1 unit: { $drop }% (×{ $factor }) before bounds are applied.
economy-admin-setting-reference = Reference volume, item units / gas moles
economy-admin-reference-help = Increasing the volume reduces the impact of one unit. Displayed percentages update while the stored strength stays unchanged.
economy-admin-setting-minimum = Minimum change from base price, % (above −100, at most 0)
economy-admin-setting-maximum = Maximum change from base price, % (at least 0)
economy-admin-setting-interval = Recovery interval, seconds (at least 1)
economy-admin-setting-decay = Recovery fraction per interval, % (0 to 100)
economy-admin-setting-margin = Protective purchase margin, % (0 to 100)
economy-admin-decay-help = Recovery of 0.15% reduces the distance to the base price by 0.15% per interval. It is not a fixed price change.
economy-admin-range-help = Narrowing the range clamps existing quotes to the new bounds and saves them. Resetting settings does not reset quotes.
economy-admin-inherit-all = Inherit all settings (draft)
economy-admin-groups-help = Impact is shown per item, or per mole for gases. Buying and selling are linked; overridden group strength is independent of the global setting. The batch preview shows bounded changes from the base price.
economy-admin-rise = Buy 1 item
economy-admin-rise-mole = Buy 1 mole
economy-admin-number-percent = %
economy-admin-number-factor = Factor: ×{ $factor }
economy-admin-per-unit = 1 item
economy-admin-per-mole = 1 mole
economy-admin-preview-moles = Preview batch, moles
economy-admin-preview-units = Preview batch, units
economy-admin-group-preview = Sell { $unit }: { $drop }% (×{ $dropFactor }) before bounds are applied.
    Selected batch from the base price: buy { $buyPercent }% (×{ $buy }), sell { $sellPercent }% (×{ $sell }).
economy-admin-quotes-help = 0% means the base price; +15% is 15% higher, −15% is 15% lower. The factor is shown alongside. Trading and recovery continue to change saved prices. Refreshing preserves drafts.
economy-admin-search = Name or market key
economy-admin-find = Search
economy-admin-all-groups = All groups
economy-admin-previous = Previous
economy-admin-next = Next
economy-admin-page = Page { $page } of { $pages }; keys: { $total }
economy-admin-quote-details = { $name }
    Market key: { $key }
    Group: { $group } ({ $groupId }); rule: { $rule }
economy-admin-quote-group = Group: { $group }
economy-admin-quote-percent-tooltip = Percentage change from the base price: 0.15 means +0.15% (×1.0015).
economy-admin-price-vs-base = Change from base: { $percent }% (×{ $factor })
economy-admin-last-movement = Last movement: { $movement }
economy-admin-last-movement-tooltip = Change relative to the previous quote. The arrow shows the last movement, not whether the item is expensive compared with its base price.
economy-admin-trend-up = ↑ rising
economy-admin-trend-down = ↓ falling
economy-admin-trend-flat = — unchanged
economy-admin-default-rule = default
economy-admin-set-quote = Save price
economy-admin-reset-quote = Reset item
economy-admin-reset-group = Reset group quotes
economy-admin-reset-all = Reset all market quotes
economy-admin-confirm-title = Confirm economy change
economy-admin-reset-confirm-1 = Are you sure?
economy-admin-reset-confirm-2 = Are you absolutely sure?
economy-admin-reset-confirm-3 = Are you absolutely, positively sure? This is a dangerous action affecting the entire database. This action will be logged
economy-admin-reset-scope = ALL MARKET QUOTES will be reset, including saved quotes outside this search (active: { $count }). Prices return to 0% change (×1); economy settings and unrelated data are unaffected.
economy-admin-mutation-confirm-3 = Are you absolutely, positively sure? This change will be saved in the database and logged.
economy-admin-confirm-settings = Save and apply the global economy settings and trade impact strengths for commodity groups. Editing a field cancels confirmation and keeps your edits.
economy-admin-confirm-set-quote = Set a { $percent }% change from the base price (×{ $factor }) for market key “{ $target }”.
economy-admin-confirm-reset-quote = Reset the quote for market key “{ $target }” to 0% change from base (×1).
economy-admin-confirm-reset-group = Reset quotes for every item in group “{ $target }” to 0% change from base (×1), including items outside this search.
economy-admin-confirm = Confirm
economy-admin-cancel = Cancel
economy-admin-apply = Save and apply
economy-admin-discard = Discard setting edits
economy-admin-discard-tooltip = Discard unsaved global settings and group strength edits, restoring the latest values received from the server. Entered percentages for individual items are kept.
economy-admin-refresh = Refresh data
economy-admin-refresh-tooltip = Fetch current server data. Unsaved settings and quote edits remain in this window.
economy-admin-empty = No items match this query.
economy-admin-loading = Loading persistent settings…
economy-admin-ready = Settings loaded.
economy-admin-saving = Saving to the database…
economy-admin-saved = Settings applied and saved.
economy-admin-quotes-saved = Quotes changed and saved.
economy-admin-cancelled = Change cancelled. Your unsaved edits remain in this window.
economy-admin-draft-clean = No unsaved settings.
economy-admin-draft-changed = The draft has changes. Save the batch to apply them.
economy-admin-draft-conflict = Server settings changed. Your draft is preserved in this window; applying is disabled. Copy any values you need, then select “Discard setting edits”.
economy-admin-invalid-number = Enter a finite number; both decimal dots and commas are accepted.
economy-admin-error-permission = You do not have permission to administer the economy.
economy-admin-error-unavailable = The economy is not ready for settings changes.
economy-admin-error-load = Could not load settings from the database. Changes are unavailable.
economy-admin-error-busy = Another operation is still saving. Try again later.
economy-admin-error-query = Invalid search query or page number.
economy-admin-error-key = Market key not found. Refresh the list.
economy-admin-error-group = Group not found. Reload the settings.
economy-admin-error-factor = Enter a finite percentage above −100 within the allowed price range.
economy-admin-error-persistence-disabled = Persistent quote storage is disabled on the server.
economy-admin-error-confirmation = The change confirmation expired or is invalid. Start again.
economy-admin-error-save = Database write failed. Changes were not applied; your draft is preserved in this window.
economy-admin-error-conflict = The settings revision is outdated. Your draft is preserved; reload current values.
economy-admin-error-invalid = The batch contains invalid settings. Check numbers and bounds; the batch was not applied.
